      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/adani-ports-soars-4-on-healthy-q2-raises-fy27-guidance-brokerages-upbeat-126102900431_1.html" rel="noopener">BS Personal Finance</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
