<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Kerala Launches Hridayaragam Home-Based Health Screening — The Daily Prompt</title>
<meta name="description" content="Kerala Health Minister K. Muraleedharan has unveiled the Hridayaragam initiative, a new government program designed to bring disease screening directl">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://news.bharatdn.com/article/2026-10-29/kerala-launches-hridayaragam-home-based-health-screening">

