     <article class="story single" data-beat="health">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">HEALTH</span> · ET Healthworld · 2026-10-29 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Maharashtra Nurses Federation Expresses Concern Over GNM Exam Irregularities</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#health</span> <span>#nursing</span> <span>#Maharashtra</span> <span>#GNM exam</span></div>
       <p>The Maharashtra General Nurses Federation (MGNF) has expressed serious concern regarding alleged irregularities during the evaluation process of GNM examination answer scripts in Solapur. The federation conveyed its concerns in a letter dated October 26.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-29/maharashtra-nurses-federation-expresses-concern-over-gnm-exa.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>In their communication, the MGNF stated, “Our federation has been working for past 50 years to address professional and social issues faced by the nursing cadre.” This highlights their long-standing commitment to the nursing profession.</p><p>The reports of alleged irregularities in the GNM examination evaluation process have prompted the federation's serious concern, underscoring the importance of fair assessment for nursing students.</p><p>What to watch: Further developments regarding the alleged irregularities.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The draft concisely reports the federation's concerns and the context provided in the summary.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://health.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/maharashtra-nurses-federation-seeks-probe-into-gnm-exam-irregularities-warns-of-statewide-protests/135299970" rel="noopener">ET Healthworld</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
       <div class="sharebar" data-href="/article/2026-10-29/maharashtra-nurses-federation-expresses-concern-over-gnm-exa" data-title="Maharashtra Nurses Federation Expresses Concern Over GNM Exam Irregularities"><b>Share:</b>
