       <h1>Ranbir Kapoor and Poorna Jagannathan Reunite at 'Ramayana' Premiere</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Ranbir Kapoor and Poorna Jagannathan reunited at the Los Angeles premiere of 'Ramayana: Rise of a Legend' at the Academy Museum of Motion Pictures on October 27. The actors, who previously starred together in the 2013 film 'Yeh Jawaani Hai Deewani', shared a nostalgic moment backstage.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-29/ranbir-kapoor-and-poorna-jagannathan-reunite-at-ramayana-pre.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The high-profile screening was attended by director Nitesh Tiwari, producer Namit Malhotra, and lead cast members Sai Pallavi and Yash. International celebrities including Jada Pinkett Smith were also present. The first part of the epic film is scheduled for a worldwide release on November 5, with the second installment expected in Diwali 2027.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief correctly identifies the event, participants, and the film's release details provided in the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
