      <ul><li><a href="https://www.theverge.com/tech/1022295/joshua-kushner-thrive-holdings-adt-acquisition" rel="noopener">The Verge</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
